Depends: @DEPENDS@, libwayland-client0, libfontconfig1, libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers | vulkan-icd, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal
Homepage: https://github.com/Felitendo/waypointer
Description: tiny hand on a stick that points at things on your screen
 Turn it on and your cursor becomes a toy hand on a stick. Click to tap, drag
 to draw, and nothing underneath gets clicked. Great for screen shares,
 recordings and presentations. The Linux version of TinyHand for macOS.
 .
 A toolbar at the bottom picks one of 36 hands or a laser dot, the ink colour
 and the volume of the tap sound. On KDE Plasma it also has global shortcuts,
 holding Alt to click for real, and a double tap on Shift to let clicks through.
 It needs a Wayland desktop with layer-shell, such as KDE Plasma, Hyprland or
 Sway.
